nsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-hongkong-hero.jpg?h=1143\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=B6DCCE63BCC25826998256F36E2169B4\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Hong Kong harbour with headlands receding into pale atmospheric layers\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1143\\\"}},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"188a8485-e04d-4007-a4b9-f3067a09d4f1\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Regions/Asia-Pacific?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Asia-Pacific\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Asia-Pacific\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Asia-Pacific\\\"},\\\"sortOrder\\\":{\\\"value\\\":40}}},\\\"shortIntro\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"A harbour, a tram line and a mountain in one skyline — one stop via Dubai.\\\"},\\\"storyBody\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eHong Kong stacks more city into less ground than anywhere else we fly. A working harbour at the bottom, a funicular that has climbed the same gradient since 1888, and above all of it a peak that is somehow still forest.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eNearly eighteen hours with a change in Dubai — the honest price of the distance. The board scores that whole itinerary at its worst point rather than at the pleasant end, so the figure you see already includes the stop.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},\\\"title\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Hong Kong\\\"},\\\"Page Design\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"e0306441-b119-4786-b0be-76b5042b8e55\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Page-Designs/Page?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"PartialDesigns\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c49bae24-0b36-44a7-b183-1e891457553f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Header\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"header\\\"}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b8724b3a-31ea-43e5-8c22-e1715f2fc64b\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Footer\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"footer\\\"}}}]}}}}],\\\"headlineValue\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"temperature\\\"},\\\"stripHeading\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"A few places, as they are today\\\"}}},{\\\"uid\\\":\\\"0fa093ab-a629-4a10-9025-9bd4668f58fd\\\",\\\"componentName\\\":\\\"WorldCard\\\",\\\"dataSource\\\":\\\"{1A1BC68D-D69B-40B6-8B67-7B9F37CE58B3}\\\",\\\"isContentResolved\\\":true,\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"worldEmptyMessage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"No routes are currently authored from this origin.\\\"},\\\"worldHeading\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Published routes\\\"},\\\"worldHomeBaseLabel\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Home base\\\"}}},{\\\"uid\\\":\\\"85de156f-9a4b-4731-8f44-c0590dab9559\\\",\\\"componentName\\\":\\\"ConditionsBoard\\\",\\\"dataSource\\\":\\\"03de9f65-930e-4442-a292-2f20a1e71948\\\",\\\"isContentResolved\\\":true,\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"ZephBoardDefaultSort\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"aqi\\\"},\\\"ZephBoardSliceSize\\\":{\\\"value\\\":10},\\\"ZephBoardSortDirection\\\":{\\\"value\\\":false},\\\"boardHeading\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Scored at the worst point of the whole journey\\\"},\\\"destinations\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"eeb9fb96-ddc0-4479-adda-3de72c9ffd8d\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/destinations/Barcelona\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Barcelona\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Barcelona\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airport\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"8fb78258-5da7-4d0e-8aef-30066bc6c27b\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Airports/Barcelona?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Barcelona\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Barcelona\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airportName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Barcelona-El Prat\\\"},\\\"cityName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Barcelona\\\"},\\\"iataCode\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"BCN\\\"},\\\"latitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":41.3},\\\"longitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":2.1},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Europe\\\"}}},\\\"cardImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-barcelona-card.jpg?h=1529\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=EC8E8A81AD1790C649005052FEDB69BC\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"A chamfered Eixample corner building in warm afternoon light\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1529\\\"}},\\\"heroImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-barcelona-hero.jpg?h=1143\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=C5EB38BE85BDA4F44FA2AD2992B6A2E5\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"The Eixample grid running from the hills down to the Mediterranean\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1143\\\"}},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"36c130cd-eb8d-45f9-a0c8-71e6651c8355\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Regions/Europe?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Europe\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Europe\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Europe\\\"},\\\"sortOrder\\\":{\\\"value\\\":10}}},\\\"shortIntro\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Gaudí spires and a Mediterranean shoreline, two hours from London.\\\"},\\\"storyBody\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eBarcelona is a working port that happens to own a beach and an unfinished cathedral. The Eixample grid runs dead straight from the hills to the water, which is why the sea gets all the way into the city most afternoons, and why the old town smells of salt rather than traffic by five.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTwo hours and five minutes from London, four days a week, on all three cabins. Short enough that the flight is not the point — long enough that arriving still feels like somewhere else.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},\\\"title\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Barcelona\\\"},\\\"Page Design\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"e0306441-b119-4786-b0be-76b5042b8e55\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Page-Designs/Page?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"PartialDesigns\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c49bae24-0b36-44a7-b183-1e891457553f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Header\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"header\\\"}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b8724b3a-31ea-43e5-8c22-e1715f2fc64b\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Footer\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"footer\\\"}}}]}}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"f023436b-fd95-4219-b19b-a9d50ee5aaa1\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/destinations/Istanbul\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Istanbul\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Istanbul\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airport\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"861dd009-6097-4c8b-a0dd-a32fdea8f098\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Airports/Istanbul?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Istanbul\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Istanbul\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airportName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Istanbul\\\"},\\\"cityName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Istanbul\\\"},\\\"iataCode\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"IST\\\"},\\\"latitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":null},\\\"longitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":null},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Europe\\\"}}},\\\"cardImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-istanbul-card.jpg?h=1529\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=5BA59EFB736AB169A4E45EEDC708D96A\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"A wooden ferry pier on the Bosphorus in winter light\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1529\\\"}},\\\"heroImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-istanbul-hero.jpg?h=1143\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=CD2797A0DC4D3392D4A1274E0A32D2D7\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"The Bosphorus at Istanbul on a still winter morning under low cloud\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1143\\\"}},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"36c130cd-eb8d-45f9-a0c8-71e6651c8355\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Regions/Europe?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Europe\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Europe\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Europe\\\"},\\\"sortOrder\\\":{\\\"value\\\":10}}},\\\"shortIntro\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Two continents, one skyline, and a market that has traded for six centuries.\\\"},\\\"storyBody\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eIstanbul straddles the Bosphorus: Europe on one bank, Asia on the other, and a ferry between them for the price of a token. The Grand Bazaar has been trading on the same site since the 1450s and still shuts on Sundays.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOne honest note. We have not yet recorded coordinates for the airport here, so Istanbul reads \\u003cem\\u003eNot scored\\u003c/em\\u003e on the board and on this page — not because the air is bad, but because we will not print a figure we have not measured. The fare, the schedule and three departures a week are unaffected.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},\\\"title\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Istanbul\\\"},\\\"Page Design\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"e0306441-b119-4786-b0be-76b5042b8e55\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Page-Designs/Page?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"PartialDesigns\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c49bae24-0b36-44a7-b183-1e891457553f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Header\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"header\\\"}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b8724b3a-31ea-43e5-8c22-e1715f2fc64b\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Footer\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"footer\\\"}}}]}}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"a9bc4779-92ea-419f-8afb-845436faa24c\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/destinations/Accra\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Accra\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Accra\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airport\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"aca242a9-d13e-43f6-adf5-295547887a3f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Airports/Accra?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Accra\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Accra\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airportName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Kotoka International\\\"},\\\"cityName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Accra\\\"},\\\"iataCode\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"ACC\\\"},\\\"latitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":5.6},\\\"longitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":-0.2},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Africa\\\"}}},\\\"cardImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-accra-card.jpg?h=1529\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=BA849FACC9B65B41618D8443AE83D042\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Wooden fishing canoes drawn up on the sand at Accra\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1529\\\"}},\\\"heroImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-accra-hero.jpg?h=1143\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=2E3DE31750D41A9034EE6448F3A1FEDC\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"The Gulf of Guinea shoreline at Accra in hazy morning light\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1143\\\"}},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"373245de-8444-46cb-8470-2ad5ab71389f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Regions/Africa?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Africa\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Africa\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Africa\\\"},\\\"sortOrder\\\":{\\\"value\\\":20}}},\\\"shortIntro\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"West African energy on the Gulf of Guinea, one stop via Casablanca.\\\"},\\\"storyBody\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eAccra meets the Atlantic along a low, wide coast, and the city runs on the noise of it — Highlife spilling out of shopfronts, jollof over charcoal at the roadside, a market that negotiates in three languages before breakfast.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe Harmattan blows down off the Sahara around December and changes the air over the whole coast for weeks at a time. We do not average that away. The panel beside this page reports what it is doing today, and because the service connects through Casablanca, the board scores the connection too.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},\\\"title\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Accra\\\"},\\\"Page Design\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"e0306441-b119-4786-b0be-76b5042b8e55\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Page-Designs/Page?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"PartialDesigns\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c49bae24-0b36-44a7-b183-1e891457553f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Header\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"header\\\"}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b8724b3a-31ea-43e5-8c22-e1715f2fc64b\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Footer\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"footer\\\"}}}]}}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"f5a0ae28-daaf-4857-86e5-20666a99312f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/destinations/Dubai\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dubai\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Dubai\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airport\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"683e3eb2-9505-4144-b11d-9141b784ca0f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Airports/Dubai?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dubai\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Dubai\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airportName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Dubai International\\\"},\\\"cityName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Dubai\\\"},\\\"iataCode\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"DXB\\\"},\\\"latitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":25.3},\\\"longitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":55.4},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Middle East\\\"}}},\\\"cardImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-dubai-card.jpg?h=1529\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=7F733EF4B8C61957515BDB6299799050\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Dubai towers layered through desert dust above a dune ridge\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1529\\\"}},\\\"heroImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-dubai-hero.jpg?h=1143\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=D7141EBDF32D5E3AC7F8C5AA46349AD4\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"The Dubai skyline seen across open desert through airborne dust\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1143\\\"}},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"005e9c21-7ceb-4548-9895-025f14d2a465\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Regions/Middle-East?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Middle East\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Middle East\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Middle East\\\"},\\\"sortOrder\\\":{\\\"value\\\":30}}},\\\"shortIntro\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Desert engineering at full scale, just under seven hours direct.\\\"},\\\"storyBody\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eDubai builds upward and outward at once — a coastline that was drawn rather than found, under a skyline that keeps adding storeys. It is the busiest direct route on the network, twice a day every day, and the point where the long eastbound services change aircraft.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIt also sits in a desert, and desert air behaves like desert air: dust matters more than traffic, and it moves with the wind rather than with the working week. Read the panel the morning you fly, not the month before.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},\\\"title\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Dubai\\\"},\\\"Page Design\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"e0306441-b119-4786-b0be-76b5042b8e55\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Page-Designs/Page?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"PartialDesigns\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c49bae24-0b36-44a7-b183-1e891457553f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Header\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"header\\\"}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b8724b3a-31ea-43e5-8c22-e1715f2fc64b\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Footer\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"footer\\\"}}}]}}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3743677e-d8e5-4f71-acd5-a7bada4e4f22\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/destinations/Hong-Kong\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Hong Kong\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Hong Kong\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airport\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"1c00751c-9af3-4b1f-baff-55079b3740e2\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Airports/Hong-Kong?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Hong Kong\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Hong Kong\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airportName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Hong Kong International\\\"},\\\"cityName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Hong Kong\\\"},\\\"iataCode\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"HKG\\\"},\\\"latitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":22.3},\\\"longitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":113.9},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Asia-Pacific\\\"}}},\\\"cardImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-hongkong-card.jpg?h=1529\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=8CC0419DBD8AD7CB24A9A1474D495BFC\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Hong Kong residential towers rising out of subtropical forest\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1529\\\"}},\\\"heroImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-hongkong-hero.jpg?h=1143\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=B6DCCE63BCC25826998256F36E2169B4\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Hong Kong harbour with headlands receding into pale atmospheric layers\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1143\\\"}},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"188a8485-e04d-4007-a4b9-f3067a09d4f1\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Regions/Asia-Pacific?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Asia-Pacific\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Asia-Pacific\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Asia-Pacific\\\"},\\\"sortOrder\\\":{\\\"value\\\":40}}},\\\"shortIntro\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"A harbour, a tram line and a mountain in one skyline — one stop via Dubai.\\\"},\\\"storyBody\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eHong Kong stacks more city into less ground than anywhere else we fly. A working harbour at the bottom, a funicular that has climbed the same gradient since 1888, and above all of it a peak that is somehow still forest.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eNearly eighteen hours with a change in Dubai — the honest price of the distance. The board scores that whole itinerary at its worst point rather than at the pleasant end, so the figure you see already includes the stop.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},\\\"title\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Hong Kong\\\"},\\\"Page Design\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"e0306441-b119-4786-b0be-76b5042b8e55\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Page-Designs/Page?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"PartialDesigns\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c49bae24-0b36-44a7-b183-1e891457553f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Header\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"header\\\"}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b8724b3a-31ea-43e5-8c22-e1715f2fc64b\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Footer\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"footer\\\"}}}]}}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"f1b14fb8-4b0f-42b1-ab63-ebcad6db398e\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/destinations/New-York\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"New York\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"New York\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airport\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"9f03ec88-9dff-43c9-82b7-b40da82e2367\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Airports/New-York-JFK?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"New York JFK\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"New York JFK\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airportName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"John F. Kennedy International\\\"},\\\"cityName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"New York\\\"},\\\"iataCode\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"JFK\\\"},\\\"latitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":40.6},\\\"longitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":-73.8},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Americas\\\"}}},\\\"cardImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-newyork-card.jpg?h=1529\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=9185867D4C142E4F69EC051321F6E498\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"An empty Manhattan avenue canyon with evening light on the upper floors\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1529\\\"}},\\\"heroImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-newyork-hero.jpg?h=1143\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=69998848FAA5300B9C4E2F25024E5723\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"The Manhattan skyline in low evening light across flat water\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1143\\\"}},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"24030006-2475-4931-9af3-bb6904c10b70\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Regions/Americas?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Americas\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Americas\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Americas\\\"},\\\"sortOrder\\\":{\\\"value\\\":50}}},\\\"shortIntro\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Eight hours west, twice a day — and a skyline that reads differently every time the light changes.\\\"},\\\"storyBody\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eNew York rewards a first visit and a hundredth one about equally, because the thing you came to look at will not hold still: the same skyline reads hard at noon, then soft, then gold, inside forty minutes of a clear October evening.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eJust under eight hours west, twice daily, every day of the week. It is the one route on the network where you land, by the clock on the wall, less than three hours after you took off — the Atlantic hands back five of them on the way over.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},\\\"title\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"New York\\\"},\\\"Page Design\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"e0306441-b119-4786-b0be-76b5042b8e55\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Page-Designs/Page?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Page\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"PartialDesigns\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c49bae24-0b36-44a7-b183-1e891457553f\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Header\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Header\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"header\\\"}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b8724b3a-31ea-43e5-8c22-e1715f2fc64b\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Presentation/Partial-Designs/Footer\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Footer\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"Base Partial Design\\\":null,\\\"Signature\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"footer\\\"}}}]}}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"9b31f9d4-8445-4936-a8c6-d48fbc0023fe\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/destinations/Lisbon\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Lisbon\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Lisbon\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airport\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b46e490d-9178-4606-9e35-1edd0dfb0cb9\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Airports/Lisbon?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Lisbon\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Lisbon\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"airportName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Humberto Delgado Airport\\\"},\\\"cityName\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Lisbon\\\"},\\\"iataCode\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"LIS\\\"},\\\"latitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":38.7813},\\\"longitude\\\":{\\\"value\\\":-9.1359},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Europe\\\"}}},\\\"cardImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-lisbon-card.jpg?h=1529\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=11DC6B67AE7CB9EEAA5AB85450D7CFE3\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"A tiled Lisbon street with tram rails climbing between azulejo facades\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1529\\\"}},\\\"heroImage\\\":{\\\"value\\\":{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://xmc-developerex211b-hahnsolo3097-cm7744.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Project/Zephira-Brand/Zephira/zeph-lisbon-hero.jpg?h=1143\\u0026iar=0\\u0026w=2048\\u0026ttc=63923840751\\u0026tt=56DD5B89A65DC058299626553F1918E2\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Lisbon rooftops stepping down to the Tagus estuary in clear morning light\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"2048\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"1143\\\"}},\\\"region\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"36c130cd-eb8d-45f9-a0c8-71e6651c8355\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/Data/Regions/Europe?sc_site=Zephira\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Europe\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Europe\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Europe\\\"},\\\"sortOrder\\\":{\\\"value\\\":10}}},\\\"shortIntro\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Pastel-tiled hills and the Atlantic light, a short hop south of home.\\\"},\\\"storyBody\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eLisbon climbs from the Tagus in tiled terraces, its trams still grinding up gradients steep enough to need them. The Atlantic reaches this city before it reaches anywhere else in Europe, and the same westerly that keeps the streets cool keeps the air over them moving.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTwo hours thirty-five, three departures a week, and the newest destination on the network. Come for the light. Stay because the walk back up the hill is worth it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},\\\"title\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Lisbon\\\"},\\\"Page Design\\\":{\\\